  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2052278203}
  m_Text: 'Hull breach ahead! When the countdown

    starts: B steers the floating
    power cell

    onto the floor socket, A restores

    gravity to seat it, then
    BOTH stand on

    the console pads.'
